is at an altitude of 530 metres on the river Jalon. The city has a wide range of shops, bars, restaurants and accommodation. The mudejar towers of churches in the old city heart or casco are renowned. Dominating the skyline is a castle, parts of which date back to 850 AD. The Roman town, Bilbilis, lies four kilometres from the modern town.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Calatayud","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Calatayud","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Calatayud is a historic town in Spain, with Bilbilis nearby among its sights. San Pedro de los Francos and the Collegiate church of Santa Maria anchor the old town, with Segeda further out. Six hours covers the sights, best April, May, September or October.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":20035,"visit_h":5.8}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-collegiate-church-of-santa-maria","name":"Collegiate church of Santa María","kind":"Church","lat":41.35406,"lon":-1.64506,"dist_km":0.2,"rank_score":7.87,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Portada_de_Colegiata_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_de_Calatayud.jpg/960px-Portada_de_Colegiata_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_de_Calatayud.jpg","author":"Ignasilm","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0 es","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/es/deed.en","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Portada_de_Colegiata_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_de_Calatayud.jpg","w":2452,"h":3620,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-augusta-bilbilis","name":"Augusta Bilbilis","kind":"Ruins","lat":41.38139,"lon":-1.60306,"dist_km":4.6,"rank_score":7.1,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Calatayud_-_Museo_de_Calatayud_-_Cubiculo.jpg/960px-Calatayud_-_Museo_de_Calatayud_-_Cubiculo.jpg","author":"Ecelan","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Calatayud_-_Museo_de_Calatayud_-_Cubiculo.